Welding, also known as fusion welding, is a manufacturing process and technology for joining metals or other thermoplastic materials such as plastics by means of heating, high temperature or high pressure.During welding, cool the welding torch to prevent the high temperature of the torch.Cooling mode: air cooling and water cooling.
The torch is cooled by circulating water. The water-cooled welding gun transmits the coolant to the heating part of the gun neck through the water circulation system and then transfers the heat back to the water tank for cooling.
The light air cooling welding gun is suitable for non - continuous, welding work intensity is not small current thin parts welding. It has the characteristics of high precision and a small heat-affected area.
