2) The biting may be caused by the improper selection of welding parameters, the Angle of welding torch or the wrong position of welding torch. The power can be appropriately adjusted to change the welding parameters, adjust the attitude of welding torch and the relative position of welding torch and workpiece.
4) Too much splashing may be caused by improper selection of welding parameters, gas composition or too long extension length of welding wire. The power can be appropriately adjusted to change welding parameters, the gas proporter can be adjusted to adjust the proportion of mixed gas, and the relative position of welding torch and workpiece can be adjusted.
2) Arc fault, can not start the arc.It may be because the welding wire does not touch the workpiece or the process parameters are too small, can manually feed wire, adjust the distance between the welding torch and the weld, or adjust the process parameters appropriately.
