- If your house uses LP-gas, close the valve installed on the cylinder and fix the cylinder in a safe place using a chain before heading out.
If you must pass a flooded area, hold on to an object that floats. - While you are moving through a flooded area, read all safety signs carefully to avoid ponds, pits, drains, sewers and manholes.
Do not drive a car in a flooded area.
Do not go near a factory or a construction site.
- If you cannot evacuate, hide under a hard surface and protect your head.
