New Year, New Travels!
End of festivities and also vacations for many people who extended the holiday break until the end of the first week of January. Considering the strength of the first week, this is the first working Monday of the year, a day that usually carries that dose of hangover and I want more – vacation and rest, not work.
I got out of bed in full swing this first working Monday of 2022!
Improving your diet and doing physical exercises are usually at the top of the list, but as life needs balance to be good, traveling and discovering new places also deserve to be highlighted in New Year's resolutions. I can't help you with diet or physical exercise tips, as I'm also part of the group that needs to improve in these areas, but in this 2022 my purpose is to bring you tips on incredible places to visit every Monday of the year.
Sometimes that incredible place is closer to us than we think, other times we need more programming to get there, but no place in the world is too far for us!
