And since the Christmas mood is everywhere, how about we think of a nice drink to serve guests at Christmas dinner?
So, my suggestion is to keep the Christmas atmosphere in this area so dear to Brazilians with the Emerald drink. The name is fancy, the look is gorgeous, and the taste is terrific.
So, let's put the shaker to work and prepare a delicious drink option to serve at our end of year parties!
How to prepare: Mix everything in a cocktail shaker and serve in a glass with crushed ice. For a more beautiful visual effect, use a martini glass and decorate with a red straw.
