The Altiplanic Lagoons are the remote Miscanti and Miñiques lagoons. Located at an altitude of more than four thousand meters, it offers a tour with surprising scenery featuring the peace and quiet of the desert and the colorful salt lakes.
As you walk the trails that wind around this watery paradise, there's no doubt you'll want to grab your camera and capture this landscape of vast open skies, towering peaks looming over the horizon and the colors of the sunset on the Salar de Atacama mirrored in Chaxa Lagoon while Flamingos fly across the sky.
The new Brazilian version of the musical “The Addams Family” premiered yesterday (10/03) at Teatro Renault. The hit on Broadway for more than a decade arrives in São Paulo for an amazingly entertaining season on the stage of the first theater built exclusively for musicals in São Paulo.
The characters of the eccentric family of macabre tastes were originally created in 1930 by the American cartoonist Charles Addams, but their success was so great that they won television, cinematographic and theatrical versions. The success of The Addams Family exploded in the 1990s, when the film version conquered fans around the world, delighted with the morbid humor that satirizes the ideal of the American family.
