The Museum of Illusions in São Paulo is a fun program for audiences of all ages, demonstrating in a simple way knowledge about optical illusions and the relationship between time, space and consciousness. Complex concepts become easily understood through the interactive and playful experience that the museum provides to its visitors, demonstrating the power of optical illusions that we don't even think about until we encounter the situations portrayed by the museum.
