The metal powder is used as the bonding agency, which means it will be consumed gradually and help to expose the diamond particles during the working. It is a mixture of different metals like Cu, Sn, Ag, Co, Ni, WC, Mo, etc.
• Cu – Copper powder acts as an adhesive, sometimes it is the main component of the metal powder (such as marble diamond segments, etc.)
• Co – Cobalt powder has high-temperature resistance, and it is used to improve the thermal stability of the metal, it is usually used in dry diamond cutting tools and dry diamond drilling tools.
