The last thing that you want to do is to spend money on a new bike to find that it doesn’t hold up over time like you thought it would. This is why it is so important to do your research before you go ahead and make a decision.
Carbon fiber bikes are continually being developed and improved as time goes on, and technical advancements in the weave and epoxy are taking place to ensure that the highest quality materials are being used to make them. These bike frames are designed and constructed in a way that ensures that there is strength in the frame areas where it is needed the most.
